2. WHAT YOU MAY DO

   If you are a Licensed User, you may:

   a. install and use the software on computers you own or control;
   b. edit your own videos with it, and publish them;
   c. edit videos for your paying clients with it;
   d. customize the software for your own use, and keep your customized
      version on your own computers; and
   e. make backup copies.

   Beta Testers have these rights free of charge, for as long as the beta
   runs (see section 4).

3. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

   You may not resell, redistribute, sublicense or give away the software,
