   Keep this license and the copyright notice with every copy you make.

4. BETA TESTING

   If you are a Beta Tester:

   a. your invitation is personal: please don't pass it, or the software,
      on to anyone else;
   b. the beta version may change, contain mistakes or stop working, and
      features may be added, changed or removed;
   c. feedback you choose to send may be used to improve the software, with
      no obligation either way; and
   d. Laine Levette may end the beta at any time by telling you in writing.
      When it ends you may keep the videos you made, and either keep using
      the version you have under the terms you were given when invited, or
      become a Customer, as Laine Levette tells you at that time.

